## 2. CHAOSPhysReg —— 物理寄存器堆 cell 注入器（重点）

### 2.1 存在理由：三种注入抽象（`CHAOS/CHAOSPhysReg/CHAOSPhysReg.py:1-17`）

文件头注释是全项目的"方法论宣言"：

> "'arch_commit' : commitRenameMap.lookup(archReg) -> setReg (= original CHAOSReg behavior; **FAILS on O3** — kept for comparison only, to quantify the artifact)；
> 'arch_frontend': renameMap.lookup(archReg) -> setReg (corrected ARCH injection; targets the phys reg that in-flight instructions will read)；
> 'phys' : inject by PHYSICAL register index, regardless of which arch reg currently maps to it. **This is what ITC'23 / GeFIN do; the only abstraction benchmarkable against them. A real defective cell doesn't know arch regs.**"

三种模式的实现分叉在 `CHAOSPhysReg.cc:255-277`：

```cpp
// arch_frontend: renameMap.lookup      (in-flight mapping)
// arch_commit:   commitRenameMap.lookup (committed mapping = CHAOSReg)
...
if (fi_mode == Mode::ArchFrontend)
    phys_reg = cpu->frontRenameMap()[tid].lookup(flat);
else // ArchCommit
    phys_reg = cpu->commitRenameMapAccess()[tid].lookup(flat);
```

关键差异注释（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:158-163`）：

> "This is the key difference from CHAOSReg (which wrote the commitRenameMap phys reg via ThreadContext::setReg — **a backdoor that doesn't propagate to in-flight instructions on O3**)."

宿主侧为这三个入口开了访问器（`CHAOS/gem5/src/cpu/o3/cpu.hh:484-497`）：

```cpp
/** Accessors used by CHAOSPhysReg to reach the physical register file
 * and the two rename maps ... exposing read/write access lets an
 * external fault injector model physical-cell defects (the only
 * abstraction benchmarkable against ITC'23/GeFIN-style tools). */
PhysRegFile &physRegFile() { return regFile; }
PerThreadUnifiedRenameMap &frontRenameMap() { return renameMap; }
PerThreadUnifiedRenameMap &commitRenameMapAccess() { return commitRenameMap; }
UnifiedFreeList &physFreeList() { return freeList; }
ROB &robAccess() { return rob; }
```

### 2.2 完整参数面（`CHAOS/CHAOSPhysReg.py`）

| Param | 类型/缺省 | 语义（行号） |
|---|---|---|
| `cpu` | BaseCPU / NULL | 必须 O3CPU（:28） |
| `injectionMode` | String / "phys" | `phys \| arch_frontend \| arch_commit`（:31-36） |
| `targetPhysRegIdx` | Int / -1 | phys 模式物理寄存器号，-1=类内随机（:39-41） |
| `targetArchRegIdx` | Int / 0 | arch 模式架构寄存器号；"On aarch64 X0-X30 = 0-30 (31 = Zero, excluded)"（:42-45） |
