### 2.3 核心攻击路径 `processFault`（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:164-466`）逐段讲解

**第一步：解析目标类（:166-181）**。`both` 模式每次注入跨三类均匀抽一（:176-180），注释："a real cell doesn't know its class either; this mirrors the ITC'23/GeFIN phys abstraction"。

**第二步：解析目标物理寄存器（:188-254）**。phys 模式按类查物理寄存器数（:193-198：`numFloatPhysRegs()/numVecPhysRegs()/numIntPhysRegs()`），随机或定向取索引，再经 `floatPhysRegId/vecPhysRegId/intPhysRegId`（`regfile.hh:172-177`）拿到 PhysRegIdPtr。

**探活判据（liveness probe，:211-254）**——本注入器最著名的修正之一：

```cpp
// Liveness probe: is this physical slot currently FREE (inactive)
// or ALLOCATED (active)? Correct criterion per project notes: a phys
// reg NOT in the free list is allocated — it may be held as a source
// by in-flight renamed-but-unexecuted instructions even if no rename
// map entry currently maps it (older version superseded but not yet
// released). So "not free" = active = may be read. (The earlier
// "rename map reverse-walk" criterion was too narrow and mislabeled
// some live slots as dead, producing the dead-slot SDC anomaly.)
bool is_free = cpu->physFreeList().isFree(target_class, phys_reg);
```

判据实现：`UnifiedFreeList::isFree`（`free_list.hh:214-218`）→ `SimpleFreeList::contains`（`free_list.hh:115-126`），后者用继承技巧暴露 `std::queue` 的底层容器做 O(N) 扫描（"std::queue's underlying container is protected; derive a helper to expose it so we can scan"，:117-120）。宿主注释（`free_list.hh:109-114`）进一步解释语义："a phys reg NOT in the free list is allocated and may be read by in-flight instructions even if no rename map entry currently points to it (e.g. an in-flight inst still holds it as a source)"。

若 active，还做一次尽力而为的反向走查记录"当前哪个 arch reg 映射到它"（:226-251，int 封顶 31、float/vector 封顶 32，"AArch64 V/D/Q share the file"），但注释明确这只是诊断信息，**不是**活性真值来源。free 槽记哨兵 `chosen_arch_idx = -2`（:253）。

**第三步 A：向量按 lane 毁值（:297-357）**。

```cpp
// Buffer path: read the WHOLE vector, corrupt ONE lane, write back.
// The buffer MUST be sized to the actual vector phys reg byte width
// (AArch64 VecRegClass = up to 256B for SVE-2048b). The old fixed
// `uint8_t buf[64]` overflowed by 192B on getReg (report issue #3).
size_t vbytes = cpu->physRegFile().vecRegBytes();
if (vbytes < sizeof(uint64_t)) vbytes = sizeof(uint64_t);  // paranoia
std::vector<uint8_t> buf(vbytes, 0);
cpu->physRegFile().getReg(phys_reg, buf.data());
```

——这就是 **SVE 缓冲溢出事故**的修复：固定 64B 栈缓冲在 SVE-2048b（256B）下 getReg 溢出 192B。宿主专门开了 `vecRegBytes()`（`regfile.hh:178-183`），注释原文："the AArch64 VecRegClass is up to MaxSveVecLenInBytes = 256 (SVE-2048b), so a 64B stack buffer would overflow by 192B on getReg (report issue #3)"。

lane 解析（:311-318）：非法宽度归一为 32（:312），lane 数 = `vbytes/lane_bytes`，越界 lane 随机。lane 内掩码截断（:328）：`uint64_t lane_mask = (lw < 64) ? (mask & ((1ULL << lw) - 1)) : mask;`。lane 按 little-endian 整数读出-改-写回（:324-349）。三种故障原语在 lane 上施加：`&=~lane_mask`（stuck-0）/`|=lane_mask`（stuck-1）/`^=lane_mask`（flip）。日志追加 `[vec lane N/M width=Wbits mask=...]`（:352-357）。

**第三步 B：标量毁值 + F3 数据触发（:358-410）**。

F3 是数据依赖触发器，注释（`CHAOSPhysReg.py:75-82` + `CHAOSPhysReg.cc:361-367`）给出硅上对应：

> "models a setup/hold violation that only manifests on a specific bit pattern (method2's x10 garbage pointer appeared only under -30mV VDDAVS on specific per_cpu_offset values). No match -> skip this injection attempt entirely (no count, no log)."

实现（:368-380）：

```cpp
if (trigger_value_mask != 0 &&
    ((uint64_t)reg_val & trigger_value_mask) != trigger_value_pattern) {
    if (write_log) {
        *(log_stream->stream())
            << "Cycle: " << cpu->curCycle()
            << ", PhysReg[" << chosen_phys_idx
            << "] F3 trigger MISS: val=0x" << std::hex
            ...
            << " — injection skipped.\n";
    }
    return;  // F3: not triggered, do not inject or count
}
```

**G2 stuck-at 写路径（:381-402）**——永久故障的正确模型。以 stuck_at_zero 为例（:382-393）：

```cpp
case FaultType::StuckAtZero:
    reg_val &= ~mask;
    stats->numStuckAtZero++;
    stats->numPermanentFaults++;
    permanent_faults[{tid, chosen_phys_idx}] = {chosen, mask, true};
    // G2: arm the write-path stuck mask so the bit is forced on
    // EVERY subsequent write to this phys slot — the correct
    // permanent (cell-stuck) model. Survives program re-writes,
    // rename reuse, and spec/commit. Polarity 0 = stuck_at_zero.
    cpu->physRegFile().setStuckTarget(target_class, chosen_phys_idx,
                                      (uint64_t)mask, 0);
    break;
```

宿主侧执行点在 `regfile.hh:343-397` 的 `setReg` 写路径（int 分支，:358-366）：

```cpp
// G2: stuck-at write-path mask. Force the stuck bits on EVERY
// write to this phys slot (the correct permanent/cell-stuck
// model — survives program re-writes, rename reuse, spec/commit).
if (stuck_type == IntRegClass && (int)idx == stuck_idx) {
    if (stuck_polarity == 0) val &= ~stuck_mask;  // stuck_at_zero
    else                      val |=  stuck_mask;  // stuck_at_one
}
intRegFile.reg(idx) = val;
```

float 分支对称（:371-380）。状态声明在 `regfile.hh:211-231`（`stuck_type/stuck_idx/stuck_mask/stuck_polarity` + `setStuckTarget/clearStuckTarget`），注释直接埋葬了旧方案（`regfile.hh:211-217`）：

> "The old CHAOSPhysReg::checkPermanent periodic re-apply did NOT propagate on O3 (it re-sticks at a polled instant, missing in-flight writes between polls; same root cause as the CHAOSReg commit-vs-frontend artifact)."

`checkPermanent` 本体（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:499-527`）的自我检讨更直白（:500-508）：

> "NOTE: periodic re-apply is the WRONG stuck mechanism (see project notes). The correct one is a write-path mask hook in PhysRegFile::setReg. This periodic re-apply is kept only as a fallback for the 'arch_*' modes' compatibility and will NOT make stuck faults truly permanent on O3 ... Phys-fi_mode stuck also needs the write-path mask to be correct."

且该函数只处理 int 物理空间（:513 用 `numIntPhysRegs()` 上界 + `intPhysRegId`），_vec/float stuck 完全依赖 G2 写路径钩子。

**第四步：read-trace 闭环装订（:420-428）**。

```cpp
// Start read-tracing this phys slot until workload end, to measure
// whether the injected cell is actually read after injection.
// (Closure check: SDC|read>0 should be similar for layer2 & layer3,
//  SDC|read==0 should be ~0.) The readTraceEvent reschedules itself
// every 1000 cycles until all threads halt, then writes the final
// read count to the log.
traced_phys_idx = chosen_phys_idx;
...
cpu->physRegFile().setReadTraceTarget(target_class, chosen_phys_idx);
if (!readTraceEvent.scheduled()) {
    schedule(readTraceEvent, cpu->clockEdge(Cycles(100000)));
}
```

（注释里的 "every 1000 cycles" 与代码 `Cycles(100000)` 不一致——注释陈旧，实装为 10 万周期轮询一次。）**read-trace 的语义**是"数**被注入值**被读的次数，而非槽位被读次数"——宿主注释（`regfile.hh:185-196`）记录了这个修正：

> "This fixes the earlier bug where free-list slots showed high read counts (the slot gets re-allocated and read many times, but those reads are of the NEW value, not the injected one). reads_before_overwrite = # times the injected value was read."

计数点内联在 `regfile.hh` 三个 getReg 分支：int（:251-253）、float（:260-262）、vector blob 路径（:298-300），条件统一为 `trace_type == <class> && !trace_overwritten && idx == trace_idx` → `++reads_before_overwrite`。覆写检测在 setReg：int（:358-359）、float（:373-374）、vec blob（:415-416），命中即 `trace_overwritten = true`。注释还排除自注入污染（:353-357）：

> "(NOT the CHAOSPhysReg's own injection write — that goes through a different path before setReadTraceTarget; the trace target is set AFTER injection, so this write is a program/rename write.)"

轮询器 `readTraceCheck`（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:529-572`）：拉取 `getReadsBeforeOverwrite()`、一次性捕获 `overwritten_at_cycle`、每 10 万周期自排；全员 halted 时写 `ReadTraceFinal` 并 `clearReadTraceTarget()`。注意 `unscheduleAttackEvent`（:131-140）**故意不 squash** readTraceEvent：

> "NOTE: readTraceEvent is intentionally NOT squashed here — it must keep counting reads of the injected phys slot until the workload ends (all threads halt)."

### 2.4 攻击循环与门控

事件在**构造函数**武装（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:67-70`，无 `startup()` 覆写）：

```cpp
inter_fault_cycles_dist = std::geometric_distribution<unsigned>(probability);
unsigned next_fault_cycle_distance = inter_fault_cycles_dist(rng);
scheduleAttackEvent(first_clock + Cycles(next_fault_cycle_distance));
scheduleCheckPermanentFault(first_clock + Cycles(1));
```

`attackCheck`（:469-497）：逐线程（跳过 Halted）调 `processFault`；`max_faults` 达标即 `unscheduleAttackEvent`；重排前做 `next + curCycle() <= last_clock` 上界检查；全员 halted 停排。注意 PhysReg 的 attackCheck **没有** FPU 那条 +1 拍退避修复（对比 `CHAOSFPU.cc:224-226`）——phys 模式几乎总能命中（物理槽永远存在），故不需要。

### 2.5 Stats（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:74-86`）

| 计数器 | 语义 |
|---|---|
| `numFaultsInjected` | 总注入 |
| `numBitFlips` | 翻转故障数 |
| `numStuckAtZero` / `numStuckAtOne` | 粘 0/粘 1 故障数 |
| `numPermanentFaults` | 永久故障总数（stuck 两类之和） |

### 2.6 故障模式与硅上对应汇总

| 模式 | 硅上缺陷 |
|---|---|
| bit_flip | PRF cell 的 SEU/瞬态 |
| stuck_at_zero/one（G2 写路径） | cell 桥接/Vth 漂移导致的永久粘死位——每次写都被强制回粘 |
| F3 数据触发 | 欠压 setup/hold 违例，仅在特定位模式显现（method2 -30mV VDDAVS 实证形态） |
| phys 模式 | 真实缺陷 cell 不知 arch reg——ITC'23/GeFIN 可对比抽象 |
| NEON 分 lane | ASIMD 4x32/2x64/8x16 lane 粒度的 SDC 分层（kunpeng 920 = 128-bit ASIMD） |

