## 3. CHAOSIQ —— 发射队列依赖图唤醒注入器

### 3.1 定位与代理位置声明

§5.5（S8-1），method3/core179 的 IQ 维度："错源唤醒 + 相位竞态"（`CHAOS/CHAOSIQ/CHAOSIQ.py:3-9`）。头文件坦白代理局限（`CHAOSIQ.hh:25-27`）：

> "Reaches the ROB-head DynInst via cpu->robAccess() (**the public IQ list is not iterable**). Operates on src-ready bits / src tags as the observable IQ-state proxy. Self-driven attackEvent (IQ not a SimObject)."

### 3.2 参数面（`CHAOSIQ.py:25-40`）

| Param | 缺省 | 语义 |
|---|---|---|
| `cpu` | NULL | 必须 O3CPU |
| `probability` | 1.0 | 建议配 maxFaults=1 |
| `mode` | "src_ready_bitflip" | 四模式：`src_ready_bitflip \| tag_sub(F5) \| wake_phase(F6,deferred) \| wake_omit(F6,deferred)` |
| `targetSrcIdx` | -1 | 定向源索引，-1=numSrcs 内随机 |
| `faultMask` | 0 | src_ready_bitflip 掩码（0=随机一位） |
| `bitsToChange` | 1 | 随机位数 |
| `firstClock`/`lastClock` | 0 | 时间窗 |
| `maxFaults` | 0 | 上限（"Use 1"） |
| `rngSeed` | 0 | 种子 |
| `writeLog` | True | 写 `iq_injections.log` |
| `semanticRole` | "" | 元数据 |

### 3.3 双挂载机制：v1 attackEvent + v2 事件驱动 wake hook

构造函数（`CHAOSIQ.cc:16-57`）按模式二选一（:51-56）：

```cpp
// S8-1b: wake_omit/wake_phase are EVENT-DRIVEN (hook
// InstructionQueue::wakeDependents via cpu->chaosIQ) — do NOT
// schedule the attackEvent poller for these modes.
if (fi_mode == Mode::WakeOmit || fi_mode == Mode::WakePhase) {
    cpu->setChaosIQ(this);
}
```

`startup()`（:59-66）对应地只为非 wake 模式排事件。宿主挂点（`cpu.hh:510-511`）：

```cpp
class CHAOSIQ *chaosIQ = nullptr;
void setChaosIQ(CHAOSIQ *p) { chaosIQ = p; }
```

### 3.4 v1 路径：ROB 头代理的两种故障

`processFault`（`CHAOSIQ.cc:115-172`）。**src_ready_bitflip**（:137-145）：

```cpp
if (fi_mode == Mode::SrcReadyBitFlip) {
    // Flip the source-ready bit (false wake / missed wake). This is
    // a single-bit toggle, not a mask — ready is 1 bit per src.
    bool old_ready = head->readySrcIdx(src_idx);
    head->readySrcIdx(src_idx, !old_ready);
```
语义：false wake（就绪位误置 1 → 读到未就绪值）或 missed wake（误清 0 → 永远等不到唤醒）。宿主 API 是位打包访问器 `dyn_inst.hh:305-317`（`_readySrcIdx[idx/8]` 字节内 `bits()/replaceBits()`）。

**tag_sub（F5）**（:146-165）：

```cpp
// F5: substitute the src tag with another physReg's. srcRegIdx(idx)
// returns a const ref; _srcIdx[idx] = phys_reg_id is the setter
// (dyn_inst.hh:301). We substitute with a random valid physRegId
// from the int class (legality: same class).
// For now, just swap src tags between two sources of the same inst
// (a safe in-range substitute that doesn't need a physReg lookup).
if (nsrcs < 2) {
    stats->numLegalityRejects++;
    return;  // need >=2 srcs to swap
}
int other = (src_idx + 1) % nsrcs;
PhysRegIdPtr a = head->renamedSrcIdx(src_idx);
PhysRegIdPtr b = head->renamedSrcIdx(other);
head->renamedSrcIdx(src_idx, b);
head->renamedSrcIdx(other, a);
```

错源发射（wrong-source dispatch）的保守实现：同指令内两源互换，保证合法性（同类、必在界内）。setter 在宿主 `dyn_inst.hh:299-303`。

### 3.5 v2 路径：wake hook 的决策/执行分离

设计约束（`CHAOSIQ.hh:36-39`）：

> "Called from InstructionQueue::wakeDependents per dependent, BEFORE markSrcRegReady. **The CALLER performs the actions (addIfReady is private to the IQ); this object only DECIDES.**"

`hookWakeDependents`（`CHAOSIQ.cc:177-218`）：模式过滤 → 窗口（curCycle 域，:184-188）→ "geometric inter-arrival approximated as per-dependent Bernoulli"（:189-195）→ G5 上限 → 返回 `Omit` 或 `Defer`。注释坦承建模边界（:197-199）：

> "G5 note: a physically stuck wake path is persistent, but a SINGLE omitted/deferred wakeup is already architecturally observable (the dependent misses this producer's completion). max_faults caps the injections like the other modes."

宿主执行点一（`CHAOS/gem5/src/cpu/o3/inst_queue.cc:1172-1191`）——先弹后塞防死循环：

```cpp
// S8-1b CHAOSIQ F6 hook: wake_omit (skip this wakeup) /
// wake_phase (defer to the next wakeDependents call).
// The skipped dependent is RE-QUEUED onto the dep graph
// (pop the NEXT entry first, then re-insert the skipped
// one — pop-then-push would return the same node forever).
if (cpu->chaosIQ) {
    CHAOSIQ::HookAction act =
        cpu->chaosIQ->hookWakeDependents(dep_inst, dest_reg);
    if (act != CHAOSIQ::HookAction::None) {
        DynInstPtr skipped = dep_inst;
        dep_inst = dependGraph.pop(dest_reg->flatIndex());
        dependGraph.insert(dest_reg->flatIndex(), skipped);
        if (act == CHAOSIQ::HookAction::Defer)
            cpu->chaosIQ->recordDeferred(
                skipped, dest_reg->flatIndex());
        requeued = true;
        ++dependents;
        continue;
    }
}
```

宿主执行点二（deferred 投递，`inst_queue.cc:1082-1096`）：

```cpp
// S8-1b CHAOSIQ: deliver wakeups deferred by a previous call
// (wake_phase one-cycle delay approximation). The deferred entry is
// REMOVED from the dep graph here — leaving it queued would trip the
// drain-time "not empty" panic.
if (cpu->chaosIQ) {
    for (auto &[deferred, reg_idx] : cpu->chaosIQ->takePendingWakeups()) {
        if (!deferred->isSquashed()) {
            dependGraph.remove(reg_idx, deferred);
            deferred->markSrcRegReady();
            addIfReady(deferred);
        } else {
            dependGraph.remove(reg_idx, deferred);
        }
    }
}
```

宿主执行点三（drain 断言豁免，`inst_queue.cc:1206-1213`）：`requeued` 时跳过 `assert(dependGraph.empty(...)); dependGraph.clearInst(...)`。头文件注释（`CHAOSIQ.hh:73-78`）说明 pending_wakeups 存 `(inst, dest_reg flatIndex)` 对的原因："so delivery can remove the dep-graph entry (a delivered-but-queued entry panics at drain)"；并声明 wake_phase 只是**一拍延迟近似**——"gem5's synchronous IQ has no true phase pipeline to shift"（同 :74-76）。

### 3.6 Stats（`CHAOSIQ.cc:253-263`）

| 计数器 | 语义 |
|---|---|
| `numFaultsInjected` | 总注入 |
| `numSrcReadyBitFlips` | 就绪位翻转数 |
| `numTagSub` | F5 源标签替换数 |
| `numLegalityRejects` | 拒绝的尝试（ROB 空/无源/wake 模式误入轮询路径） |

### 3.7 故障模式与硅上对应

| 模式 | 硅上缺陷 |
|---|---|
| src_ready_bitflip | IQ ready 位单元翻转 → false wake（错值消费）或 missed wake（挂起/超时唤醒） |
| tag_sub (F5) | CAM 匹配的 tag 位翻转 → 依赖错误生产者（错源发射） |
| wake_omit (F6) | 唤醒线瞬态失效（漏唤醒） |
| wake_phase (F6) | 唤醒相位竞态（晚一拍唤醒）——文档注明它**不能**捕获 method3 相位签名（`gem5-architecture-and-chaos-internals.md:702`："wake_phase 不捕获 method3 相位签名即为一例"） |

