## 6. CHAOSReg —— 上游架构寄存器注入器（ThreadContext 路径）

### 6.1 定位：上游原版 + 本仓库的 G 系列修正

CHAOSReg 是上游 CHAOS 的原版架构寄存器注入器（`cxx_header = "CHAOSReg/CHAOSReg.hh"`，`CHAOS/CHAOSReg/CHAOSReg.py:7`——它独居于 `src/CHAOSReg/`，非 `cpu/o3/` 下），走 `ThreadContext::getReg/setReg` 后门。本仓库在其上叠加了 G0/G1/G5/G7 修正，并且它是 CHAOSPhysReg 三抽象对照实验的"反面教材"（arch_commit 模式即"原 CHAOSReg 行为，O3 上失效，保留以量化伪迹"）。

### 6.2 参数面（`CHAOSReg.py:9-26`）——注意多条参数描述本身就是踩坑记录

| Param | 类型/缺省 | 语义与坑 |
|---|---|---|
| `cpu` | BaseCPU / NULL | 任意 BaseCPU（非 O3 限定） |
| `probability` | Float / **0.0** | 缺省关闭（其它注入器缺省 1.0） |
| `bitsToChange` | Int / -1 | -1 = 随机 1..32（构造期抽取，`CHAOSReg.cc:62-65`） |
| `firstClock` | UInt64 / 0 | 起始周期 |
| `lastClock` | UInt64 / 0 | **参数描述即警告原文**（:13）："Default 0 means NO upper bound ... NOTE: diverges from README which claims default -1 / -1 means unrestricted; here 0 is the unrestricted value. **A literal -1 wraps to 0xFFFF...F via uint64 and also reads unrestricted, only by accident.** Prefer maxFaults for count control and leave this at 0 to avoid silent zero-injection." |
| `maxFaults` | UInt64 / 0 | 上限（0=原版行为） |
| `rngSeed` | UInt64 / 0 | "0 = seed from std::random_device (**original, NON-reproducible behavior**)" |
| `maxRegIdx` | UInt64 / 0 | 采样上界（:16 描述）："0 = use full numRegs()-1 (original behavior, which on ARM/aarch64 includes **integer[31]=Zero and idx>=32 banked/non-arch slots — a systematic bias**). Set to 31 on aarch64 to restrict integer injection to X0-X30" |
| `targetRegIdx` | Int / -1 | G1/report #5 定向寄存器索引（:17）："forces the fault onto this specific reg, so the manifest's target.index takes effect ... -1 = random sample within [0, maxRegIdx)" |
| `faultType` | String / "random" | `bit_flip / stuck_at_zero / stuck_at_one`（random 按权重抽） |
| `faultMask` | UInt64 / 0 | "64-bit; G1 width-aware" |
| `regTargetClass` | String / "both" | `integer / floating_point / both`（无 vector——与 PhysReg 的三分类不同） |
| `bitFlipProb` 等三权重 | Float | 0.9/0.05/0.05，和≠1 时告警并强制回缺省（`CHAOSReg.cc:72-77`） |
| `cyclesPermamentFaultCheck` | Int / 1 | 永久故障周期复查间隔 |
| `PCTarget` | Addr / 0 | 定向 PC；非零时强制 probability=1（:57-60，"it is better to set the probability to 1"） |
| `writeLog` | Bool / True | 写 `fault_injections.log` |

### 6.3 攻击路径 `processFault`（`CHAOSReg.cc:191-336`）

**类选择**（:204-225）：both 时 `rng() % 2` 二选一（int/float 有空类时退化处理）。

**索引与两处采样修正**（:230-258）：

```cpp
// Register index upper bound. The original code sampled over the full
// numRegs() of the class, which on aarch64 IntRegClass includes:
//   integer[31] = Zero (the zero register — injecting it has NO effect),
//   integer[32+] = AArch32 banked-mode copies + non-architectural slots
//   (not live in aarch64 user mode — injecting them has NO effect).
// Both systematically inflate the Masked rate and underestimate SDC.
int num_regs = reg_class->numRegs();
int upper = num_regs - 1;
if (max_reg_idx > 0 && max_reg_idx < num_regs)
    upper = max_reg_idx - 1;
```

**XZR 守卫**（:268-284）：即便全量采样，命中 integer[31] 也记日志 "XZR: architecturally discarded write -> Inactive" 并 `return`（不计入有效注入）。

**G1 宽度感知掩码**（:264-266 + :167-188）：

```cpp
// G1: width-aware, no signed-shift UB. 1ULL << bit for bit in [0,64).
// bits_to_change distinct bits; len is the register width in bits.
...
// cap bits_to_change to the width to avoid an infinite loop
if (bits_to_change > len) bits_to_change = len;
std::uniform_int_distribution<int> bitDist(0, len - 1);
// sample distinct bits (rejection sampling)
int placed = 0;
while (placed < bits_to_change) {
    int b = bitDist(gen);
    uint64_t bit = (b >= 64) ? 0 : (1ULL << b);
    if ((mask & bit) == 0) {  // not yet set -> add
        mask |= bit;
        ++placed;
    }
}
```

旧 `generateRandomMask`（:153-165）保留但注释声明其 signed-shift UB："G1: legacy 32-bit path retained for compatibility, but note it has signed-shift UB for bit >= 32. New callers use generateRandomMask64." 这与 PhysReg 的 UInt32 截断坑同源（`CHAOSPhysReg.py:68-71`）。

**写回路径**（:313）：`thread_context->setReg(reg_id, reg_val);` —— 这是全器最关键的架构分歧点。宿主链路三级：

1. `ThreadContext::setReg`（`CHAOS/gem5/src/cpu/o3/thread_context.cc:169-173`）：
```cpp
ThreadContext::setReg(const RegId &reg, RegVal val)
{
    cpu->setArchReg(reg, val, thread->threadId());
    conditionalSquash();
}
```
（`conditionalSquash`，`thread_context.hh:233-237`：无 trapPending/noSquashFromTC 时 `cpu->squashFromTC`——外部写会触发整条流水线 squash 重放。）

2. `CPU::setArchReg`（`CHAOS/gem5/src/cpu/o3/cpu.cc:1113-1118`）：
```cpp
CPU::setArchReg(const RegId &reg, RegVal val, ThreadID tid)
{
    const RegId flat = reg.flatten(*isa[tid]);
    PhysRegIdPtr phys_reg = commitRenameMap[tid].lookup(flat);
    regFile.setReg(phys_reg, val);
}
```

3. ——**只写 commitRenameMap 解析出的物理寄存器**。在飞指令（已按前端 renameMap 重命名、可能经 bypass 前递）永远看不到这次写；再加 conditionalSquash 的重放，写的效果被流水线自身冲掉。这正是 CHAOSPhysReg 三抽象注释所说的"a backdoor that doesn't propagate to in-flight instructions on O3"（`CHAOSPhysReg.cc:160-163`），也是 arch_commit 模式"FAILS on O3 — kept for comparison only, to quantify the artifact"（`CHAOSPhysReg.py:4-6`）的原因。

**checkPermanent 的修复记录**（:395-445）——注释块（:425-433）是永久故障建模史：

> "NOTE: the original code cleared `update = false` here, which meant the stuck mask was re-applied only ONCE after injection. Any subsequent program write to this register would overwrite the stuck value and the fault would silently disappear — so 'stuck_at_zero/one' were NOT actually permanent, under-applying the fault model. Leaving `update = true` so checkPermanent re-applies the mask every cyclesPermamentFaultCheck cycles, making the stuck fault truly permanent (**the correct model for real permanent defects, e.g. stuck-at faults in silicon**)."

